The [[Lucky Piggy]] is an item normally obtained by combining the [[Piggybank]] with two [[Lucky Clover]]s, making it a [[Ranger]]-exclusive. It increases the chance of chance-based effects, including [[Shield]]s and many other assorted things. It also gives two {{icon/luck}} and the gold-giving effect of the [[Piggybank]], compacting the two effects into half the total space.

The 12% chance increase stacks additively with other [[Lucky Piggy]]s and each increases the base chance of the item on the {{icon/star}} slot.
So, with one [[Lucky Piggy]], a 40% chance would become 44.8%, and with two it would be 49.6%.

The "shop entered" effect does not activate if the item is in storage.

Since update 0.9.38, critical hit chance buffs are considered "chance-based" effects and can be improved by Lucky Piggy.

==Description==
''You are so lucky to have that piggy.''

